{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-wechat-session",
  "version": "2.2.2",
  "description": "微信通道外设（v2.2.2）：不再依赖 @xmanrui/dsh-im，不接管会话生命周期。三模块——ChannelTransport（纯 iLink 协议适配器，扫码登录 + 长轮询收发）、SessionEventBridge（只读订阅 session/event / agent/assistant-stream，以会话标题行把最终回复镜像到微信、标题读不到退回短码）、ApprovalGate（approval/request / user-questions/request waterfall 应答者）。支持微信 /new 在指定工作目录对应的工作区分组薄创建会话并自动绑定（标题自动加「微信 · 」前缀，缺省「微信 · Clawbot」）、双向自由对话、多会话并行审批与选择题回填（<前缀>=1/0/c、<前缀> 1A 2B）、超时提醒卡、permissionPreset 自动降级、定时未决汇总；绑定与工作目录配置均持久化，重启免重配。零运行时依赖（iLink 协议层为纯 Node 实现）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "sweet560 <107355972+sweet560@users.noreply.github.com>",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/channel/ilink.mjs",
    "lib/channel/transport.js",
    "lib/host/bridge.js",
    "lib/host/binding-store.js",
    "lib/host/settings-store.js",
    "vendor/qrcode.cjs",
    "vendor/qrcode-generator.README.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "locale/en.json",
    "locale/zh.json",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.5.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.6.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.7.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.8.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v1.9.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v2.0.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v2.1.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v2.2.0.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v2.2.1.md",
    "docs/RELEASE_NOTES_v2.2.2.md",
    "smoke/smoke-test.mjs"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "notification",
    "wechat",
    "ilink",
    "desktop-notification",
    "reminder",
    "approval",
    "session",
    "通道外设",
    "多会话并行审批",
    "会话前缀",
    "桌面弹窗",
    "微信通知",
    "提示音",
    "超时提醒"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node smoke/smoke-test.mjs",
    "pack": "npm pack --dry-run"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/sweet560/dsh-plugin-wechat-session.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
